# WeChat NewDNS / HTTPDNS endpoints
# Captured/identified on WeChat for macOS 4.1.15 (2026-09-30)
# Cross-platform Surge ruleset for macOS / iOS.
# Intended usage:
# RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dsd1001/111/main/WeChatNewDNS.list,REJECT
#
# WARNING: These rules are global. Any app using the same DNS infrastructure
# will also be rejected.

DOMAIN,dns.wechat.com
DOMAIN,dns.weixin.qq.com
DOMAIN,dns.weixin.qq.com.cn
DOMAIN,udns.weixin.qq.com
DOMAIN,usdns.wechat.com
DOMAIN,paydns.weixin.qq.com
DOMAIN,paydns.wechat.com
IP-CIDR,119.29.29.29/32,no-resolve
